{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972990/extras/b042632dfd468e47e0174874cb6d900e.avif?t=1757499104\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infected Love: The Fatal Experiment</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Confessing Love on the Day of Infection]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When high school becomes a battlefield for survival\u2026 confessing your love might be the most important thing you do at the end of the world!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an ordinary student trapped inside an abandoned school that has become a nest of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the groans and growls, and the creeping shadows closing in, you must join forces with classmates of vastly different personalities, uncover the truth behind a failed \u201csecret experiment\u201d, and make life-changing decisions that will lead you toward love\u2026 or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story that will make your heart race \u2014 from both romance and zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Gameplay &amp; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make will shape the fate of the characters. A single decision could mean the difference between survival and loss \u2014 or unlock a one-of-a-kind romantic ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationship System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build deep bonds with your teammates through conversations, acts of support, and standing by their side in moments of crisis. Trust is the key to revealing their true selves\u2026 and perhaps finding love amidst the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; Clue-Finding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search classrooms, the teacher\u2019s lounge, the gym, the kitchen, the nurse\u2019s office, and even the sealed-off laboratory to find supplies, hidden notes, and clues that connect to the experiment that caused this catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just a bystander \u2014 you\u2019re the one making the survival plan. Choose safe routes, manage scarce resources, and decide whether to risk everything to uncover the truth or retreat to keep your team alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspenseful Atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoing footsteps in empty halls, doors slowly creaking open on their own, and shadows shifting in the darkness \u2014 every step will make you feel like something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Characters with Unique Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Luna \u2013 Sharp hearing and keen senses allow her to detect danger before anyone else. She\u2019s the team\u2019s natural radar for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Miya \u2013 Intelligent and cautious, she excels at planning and resource management, keeping the group alive efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scarlet \u2013 A charming \u201ckey master\u201d who holds the keys to various rooms and knows the school\u2019s hidden corners better than anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kim \u2013 A tech-savvy nerd trying to restore contact with the outside world. His knowledge of communication devices and security systems is a vital lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972990?t=1757499104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972990/6159a2d6ad242080f798f012dded6f8fac109f49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757499104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972990/bbdb15c2a552a3b408723384eef36786c07175